# #38 (docs/phase-nav-brief.md, "C: verification"): the Settings split
# screen (D11, D13 the capacity panel) and a split leaf (D8, Backlight:
# "draw_into_panel" + ui_panel_select_screen(), tile + current value).
# Needs agent B's screens/settings.c and ui_preview_capacity (D13), which
# have landed: Settings is now the real 17-row tree (apps/ipodui/screens/
# settings.c items[]), and "Backlight" is index 6 from the top (the
# wheel count below, verified against items[]/item_lang[]): About,
# Shuffle, Repeat, Main Menu, Music Menu, Volume Limit, Backlight. It is
# the only row using the real split choice_screen ("settings-choice");
# every other row but About (ui_preview_capacity) still pushes the plain
# ui_stub_screen (no panel) until its own detail screen lands.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-nav-settings.script
# golden: skip settings_push_mid backlight_push_mid

wait 4000           # boot to the main menu, "Music" selected

wheel +3             # "Settings" (4th main-menu row)
wait 400
key SELECT 50
shot settings_push_mid   # (timing) sliding in
wait 1200            # past NAV_REST_ICON: the capacity panel arrives
shot settings_top    # split (post-B): list x 0-159, header above it,
                      # the capacity panel x 160-319 (device name, the
                      # wheel glyph, the capacity bar, "N GB Free", D13).
                      # Stub (pre-B): the old flat 30-row list, no panel.

wheel +6              # "Backlight" (see the header comment above)
wait 400
key SELECT 50
shot backlight_push_mid  # (timing) sliding in
wait 500              # past NAV_REST_ICON: the leaf's own panel arrives
shot backlight_top    # split leaf (post-B, D8): panel shows the tile and
                      # the current brightness value. Stub (pre-B): a
                      # plain full-width ui_stub_screen, no panel.

wheel +1              # change the value (post-B: ui_panel_invalidate(),
wait 500              # the panel cross-fades to the new value, still
                      # after a rest delay, NAV_REST_ICON)
shot backlight_changed

key MENU
wait 700
shot back_to_settings

quit
